WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 24=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(Wei the Fool's Trump Card)

00:43.640 --> 00:44.439
Wei Hao.

00:45.839 --> 00:46.720
You're here, girl.

00:49.360 --> 00:50.440
Who bullied you?

00:53.439 --> 00:54.240
Good heavens.

00:54.439 --> 00:55.000
Who?

00:55.039 --> 00:55.720
Who bullied you?

00:55.720 --> 00:56.359
Tell me.

00:56.359 --> 00:57.199
I'll kill them.

00:57.359 --> 00:58.080
Don't worry.

00:58.080 --> 00:59.079
We still have gunpowder at home.

00:59.079 --> 01:00.390
Even if we didn't, I could make more.

01:01.320 --> 01:02.320
Just tell me.

01:02.359 --> 01:03.359
Who bullied you?

01:03.359 --> 01:04.440
I'll make sure they're dead.

01:05.320 --> 01:06.920
The great clans have united,

01:07.719 --> 01:10.839
forcing Father to withdraw
the imperial decree for our marriage.

01:11.440 --> 01:12.600
If he doesn't,

01:13.199 --> 01:16.159
all of them will resign
from their posts and leave.

01:16.799 --> 01:17.719
What nonsense is that?

01:18.200 --> 01:19.359
Withdraw the imperial decree?

01:20.280 --> 01:21.799
Tell my father-in-law that it's fine.

01:21.799 --> 01:24.190
Just stall for six or seven days
until the clan leaders arrive.

01:24.200 --> 01:25.840
As for our matter,
he doesn't need to worry.

01:25.840 --> 01:27.399
He just needs to keep stalling.

01:29.159 --> 01:30.840
Do you really have a way?

01:32.799 --> 01:33.679
Even if the sky falls,

01:33.679 --> 01:34.799
I'll be there to hold it up.

01:35.799 --> 01:37.520
Those clans aren't worth a darn.

01:37.520 --> 01:38.479
I can crush them in minutes.

01:38.479 --> 01:39.640
Resigning and leaving?

01:39.650 --> 01:41.460
Forcing my father-in-law
to withdraw the decree?

01:41.479 --> 01:43.310
Where do they get
the nerve to do this to me?

01:44.399 --> 01:45.679
Just rest easy.

01:45.840 --> 01:47.640
Go back and prepare to marry me.

01:48.879 --> 01:50.599
Is everything you said true?

01:51.439 --> 01:53.000
When have I ever lied to you?

01:53.120 --> 01:54.000
On the other hand,

01:54.200 --> 01:55.840
you've lied to me plenty of times.

01:58.700 --> 01:59.920
You look pretty when you smile.

02:00.159 --> 02:02.239
You look better when you're smiling.

02:05.359 --> 02:06.319
But

02:06.760 --> 02:08.519
if this doesn't work out,

02:08.799 --> 02:10.079
what should we do?

02:12.200 --> 02:13.840
I already said it.
How could it not work?

02:14.079 --> 02:14.879
Who dares stop me?

02:14.879 --> 02:16.599
I'll dig up their family's very roots.

02:16.599 --> 02:17.439
Trying to block me?

02:17.439 --> 02:18.640
Who gave them the courage?

02:19.280 --> 02:19.920
And you,

02:19.920 --> 02:20.840
don't take it to heart.

02:23.760 --> 02:24.239
Right.

02:24.640 --> 02:26.920
Tell my father-in-law
to let me out for the next few days.

02:26.920 --> 02:28.090
I need to prepare some things.

02:28.640 --> 02:29.959
What do you need to prepare?

02:30.200 --> 02:31.719
Things to deal with the great clans.

02:31.720 --> 02:33.380
As for everything else,
don't worry about it.

02:33.400 --> 02:34.400
I'll handle them.

02:35.719 --> 02:36.760
Don't cry anymore.

02:37.400 --> 02:39.760
Also, don't go running out
in this cold weather.

02:39.760 --> 02:41.319
Didn't I install a heater at your place?

02:41.640 --> 02:43.840
Just stay in the palace
and wait for my good news.

02:44.519 --> 02:45.319
Okay.

02:45.879 --> 02:47.120
I'll believe you.

02:47.360 --> 02:49.159
If you don't believe me,
who can you believe?

02:49.159 --> 02:50.510
Even Father-in-law is unreliable.

02:51.200 --> 02:52.719
It's a good thing Father isn't here.

02:52.879 --> 02:53.680
Otherwise,

02:53.680 --> 02:55.319
the two of you would be arguing again.

02:55.439 --> 02:57.199
How could I argue with my father-in-law?

02:57.520 --> 02:58.719
He has a plan?

03:00.680 --> 03:02.400
He told me not to worry.

03:02.759 --> 03:03.560
Also,

03:03.800 --> 03:05.680
he asked you to stall
for six or seven days.

03:06.719 --> 03:08.680
Just wait until the clan leaders arrive.

03:09.039 --> 03:09.840
One more thing.

03:10.159 --> 03:12.159
He said to let him
out in a couple of days.

03:12.199 --> 03:13.439
He needs to prepare some things

03:13.439 --> 03:14.800
to deal with the great clans.

03:15.479 --> 03:16.400
No problem.

03:17.639 --> 03:18.840
Did he really say

03:18.840 --> 03:19.879
that he has a way?

03:22.039 --> 03:24.360
What plan could the fool have?

03:25.360 --> 03:28.479
Just because you don't have a way
doesn't mean he doesn't.

03:28.960 --> 03:30.360
Could you have thought of glaze?

03:30.560 --> 03:32.080
Could you have thought of the heaters?

03:33.039 --> 03:33.840
In any case,

03:34.000 --> 03:36.680
my son-in-law has
more tricks than you do.

03:39.275 --> 03:41.600
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

03:42.520 --> 03:43.159
Young Master.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.080
Young Master.

03:55.850 --> 04:00.937
(Ganlu Palace)

04:10.300 --> 04:13.700
(Ganlu Palace)

04:35.725 --> 04:37.100
(Friend)

04:53.037 --> 04:57.087
(Friend)

04:59.575 --> 05:05.437
(Having friends come from far away,
isn't that happiness?)

05:09.312 --> 05:10.025
(Cui Xian, Great Cui Clan Leader)

05:10.079 --> 05:10.759
Father,

05:11.160 --> 05:12.560
I can't believe you actually came.

05:13.480 --> 05:15.800
This place has been redecorated?

05:15.800 --> 05:16.560
Yes, Father.

05:17.639 --> 05:18.759
It's done.

05:23.800 --> 05:24.480
Father,

05:25.279 --> 05:26.519
it's been a long journey.

05:27.959 --> 05:28.759
Have some tea

05:29.160 --> 05:29.959
to refresh yourself.

05:36.639 --> 05:39.319
The leaders of the other clans

05:39.800 --> 05:41.639
should be arriving soon, shouldn't they?

05:41.879 --> 05:43.480
I don't know for sure yet,

05:43.639 --> 05:45.439
but I heard they are all coming.

05:45.759 --> 05:46.240
Father,

05:46.750 --> 05:48.120
by coming here together this time,

05:48.480 --> 05:50.319
aren't you thinking
too highly of the brat?

05:51.160 --> 05:51.800
Him?

05:53.240 --> 05:54.600
A mere Marquis?

05:55.319 --> 05:56.519
He's a nobody.

05:57.439 --> 05:58.560
This time,

05:59.040 --> 06:00.560
we are contending with His Majesty.

06:01.879 --> 06:03.560
If His Majesty wins,

06:04.079 --> 06:06.120
all our previous agreements

06:06.480 --> 06:08.079
will mean absolutely nothing.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.240
For so long,

06:12.759 --> 06:15.079
you lot haven't been
able to deal with that brat.

06:15.639 --> 06:17.000
If we hadn't come,

06:17.010 --> 06:18.990
how much longer would
you have dragged this out?

06:21.839 --> 06:24.759
His Majesty certainly
wants to delay things.

06:26.920 --> 06:28.279
Wishful thinking.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.480
Yes.

06:30.959 --> 06:31.759
It's just

06:32.279 --> 06:33.720
that in the capital right now,

06:34.800 --> 06:36.720
the public's opinion of us isn't great.

06:36.720 --> 06:37.480
I'm just worried...

06:37.480 --> 06:39.160
Why care about them?

06:39.839 --> 06:42.399
We aren't the ones ruling the world.

06:44.160 --> 06:45.680
Who would care

06:46.240 --> 06:47.560
what the commoners say?

06:48.279 --> 06:50.199
Would the officials
in the Imperial Court care,

06:50.360 --> 06:51.959
or would His Majesty care?

06:54.680 --> 06:56.560
Since no one cares,

06:56.879 --> 06:58.639
whatever the commoners say

06:59.040 --> 07:00.079
doesn't matter.

07:01.399 --> 07:02.639
When have the great clans

07:03.079 --> 07:06.240
ever cared about those common people?

07:07.399 --> 07:08.600
Yes, Father.

07:10.040 --> 07:11.759
I need to rest.

07:12.399 --> 07:13.839
Riding in that carriage all the way,

07:15.120 --> 07:17.120
my old bones are about to fall apart.

07:17.120 --> 07:18.240
Watch your step, Father.

07:20.680 --> 07:21.120
Come.

07:22.650 --> 07:25.550
(Juxian Restaurant)

07:27.279 --> 07:28.199
Take care.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.439
Business is so good.

07:32.487 --> 07:33.886
(Wang Hairuo, Great Wang Clan Leader)
This owner

07:34.279 --> 07:35.920
must be making quite a profit.

07:36.319 --> 07:37.040
Clan Leader,

07:37.040 --> 07:38.480
this is Wei Hao's property.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.600
The profits are staggering,

07:39.600 --> 07:40.839
but no one dares to touch it.

07:42.319 --> 07:43.959
Why does no one dare touch it?

07:44.560 --> 07:47.160
Only the Wei clan
knows how to cook like this.

07:47.519 --> 07:50.040
I heard people in the palace
know how now, too.

07:50.639 --> 07:52.560
But the palace sent out word

07:52.879 --> 07:53.920
that if

07:54.040 --> 07:55.879
anyone leaks the secret,

07:55.879 --> 07:56.920
it's a capital offense.

07:57.759 --> 07:59.839
If anyone else in the market could make

07:59.839 --> 08:02.079
dishes like those at Juxian Restaurant,

08:02.720 --> 08:05.000
the palace would
likely send investigators.

08:05.000 --> 08:06.279
So, no one dares touch

08:06.480 --> 08:07.480
this restaurant.

08:08.439 --> 08:10.639
A mere Wei Hao from the Wei clan

08:11.480 --> 08:13.439
already caused you a lot of trouble.

08:15.959 --> 08:18.920
Currently, we still have
no share in the glaze business.

08:19.600 --> 08:20.839
The merchants trading glazeware

08:20.839 --> 08:23.000
are all making a fortune,

08:23.000 --> 08:24.800
while we can only watch.

08:25.560 --> 08:26.639
Wei Hao

08:27.160 --> 08:28.399
is truly ruthless.

08:28.480 --> 08:31.279
We must deal with
Wei Hao severely this time.

08:32.079 --> 08:34.079
Otherwise, if he continues his antics,

08:34.240 --> 08:36.759
who knows how much
more trouble he'll cause us?

08:36.920 --> 08:39.279
Once he marries the Eldest Princess,

08:40.399 --> 08:42.240
where will the reputation
of the great clans

08:42.639 --> 08:44.600
be then?

08:45.399 --> 08:46.199
And another thing,

08:46.800 --> 08:49.120
he blew up our mansions in the capital.

08:49.360 --> 08:50.759
There's been no apology

08:50.959 --> 08:52.160
or compensation.

08:52.639 --> 08:53.439
What?

08:53.920 --> 08:55.879
Does Wei Hao have so much confidence

08:56.360 --> 08:58.160
that he thinks he can act with impunity

08:59.040 --> 09:02.000
just because the Emperor supports him?

09:02.879 --> 09:04.519
Let him act out for a few more days.

09:04.959 --> 09:06.959
Didn't he want us to come see him?

09:07.040 --> 09:08.199
We are all here.

09:08.199 --> 09:10.279
Let's see if he dares to show up then.

09:15.080 --> 09:17.320
Actually, it doesn't matter
if you meet him.

09:17.320 --> 09:18.720
He is just a green boy.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.190
He can't cause much trouble.

09:20.559 --> 09:21.799
The glaze business

09:21.840 --> 09:23.080
is very profitable.

09:23.279 --> 09:25.039
It's a pity it went
to the Imperial Family.

09:25.879 --> 09:27.519
If it had been given to the great clans,

09:27.759 --> 09:28.759
our clans

09:29.759 --> 09:31.200
could have cultivated

09:31.200 --> 09:33.120
so many more talented people.

09:33.480 --> 09:35.080
What a shame.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.960
My fellow brothers.

09:39.039 --> 09:40.000
My fellow brothers.

09:40.000 --> 09:40.759
Mister Wei.

09:40.850 --> 09:41.919
Sorry to keep you waiting.

09:41.919 --> 09:42.799
Please.

09:43.279 --> 09:44.080
Have a seat.

09:46.600 --> 09:47.519
Actually,

09:47.600 --> 09:49.440
I should have been
the one hosting this meal,

09:49.440 --> 09:52.240
but I didn't expect
Mister Cui to beat me to it.

09:52.919 --> 09:53.720
How about this?

09:53.840 --> 09:54.960
Tonight,

09:54.960 --> 09:55.919
dinner is on me.

09:56.159 --> 09:57.440
Right here,

09:57.480 --> 09:59.000
in this same private room.

09:59.000 --> 10:01.200
I've already spoken to the manager

10:01.200 --> 10:03.519
and reserved this room.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.399
We've known each other long enough,

10:07.400 --> 10:08.610
so let's skip the formalities.

10:09.039 --> 10:09.919
Tell us.

10:10.919 --> 10:13.159
Now that the Wei clan
has produced such a person,

10:13.480 --> 10:14.840
how should he be handled?

10:16.120 --> 10:16.919
Mister Cui,

10:17.320 --> 10:18.679
what do you mean by that?

10:20.360 --> 10:22.879
The marriage between Wei Hao
and the Eldest Princess

10:23.120 --> 10:24.759
must never happen.

10:25.320 --> 10:27.039
If we fail,

10:27.440 --> 10:29.039
how can we

10:29.200 --> 10:32.320
ever hold our heads high
before His Majesty again?

10:33.039 --> 10:33.759
Wei,

10:34.480 --> 10:35.559
regarding this matter,

10:35.600 --> 10:37.720
you must give us an explanation.

10:38.120 --> 10:39.600
- That's right.
- Yes, indeed.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.799
You must give us an explanation.

10:40.799 --> 10:42.799
This concerns all of our futures.

10:42.799 --> 10:43.480
Exactly.

10:44.519 --> 10:45.440
As long as

10:45.720 --> 10:47.840
you don't take his life.

10:48.919 --> 10:50.240
As you all know,

10:50.240 --> 10:52.480
this young man is the only son
in five generations.

10:52.960 --> 10:55.080
If you were to take his life,

10:55.080 --> 10:56.480
that would be a tragedy.

10:57.039 --> 10:57.960
Aside from that,

10:58.320 --> 10:59.600
whatever you say we should do,

10:59.840 --> 11:00.879
we will do.

11:01.759 --> 11:02.679
After all,

11:02.799 --> 11:05.279
the brat is ignorant.

11:05.840 --> 11:08.519
I am simply at my wits' end.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.679
Furthermore,

11:10.279 --> 11:12.080
he is a member of the Wei clan.

11:12.559 --> 11:16.559
It wouldn't be right for me
to kick him while he's down.

11:37.912 --> 11:40.742
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:41.362 --> 11:44.762
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:45.532 --> 11:48.482
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:48.822 --> 11:51.522
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:53.122 --> 11:56.592
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:56.592 --> 11:58.822
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:58.822 --> 12:00.932
♪Colors and darkness♪

12:00.932 --> 12:02.952
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

12:02.952 --> 12:07.312
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

12:08.752 --> 12:12.482
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

12:12.752 --> 12:16.352
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

12:16.512 --> 12:18.592
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

12:18.592 --> 12:23.382
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

12:23.602 --> 12:25.222
♪The world mistakes me♪

12:25.222 --> 12:27.562
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

12:27.632 --> 12:28.822
♪As the storm approaches♪

12:28.822 --> 12:31.222
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

12:31.432 --> 12:33.152
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

12:33.152 --> 12:35.132
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

12:35.302 --> 12:37.052
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

12:37.052 --> 12:39.152
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

12:39.152 --> 12:40.622
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

12:40.622 --> 12:42.852
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:43.072 --> 12:44.272
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:44.272 --> 12:46.792
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:46.922 --> 12:48.632
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:48.632 --> 12:49.912
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:50.062 --> 12:51.482
♪My wish has finally come true♪

12:51.482 --> 12:52.522
♪To stay by your side♪

12:52.522 --> 12:54.442
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:54.612 --> 12:57.862
♪We are free and happy♪

13:01.862 --> 13:03.642
♪From a nobody♪

13:03.642 --> 13:05.542
♪To someone now famous♪

13:05.652 --> 13:07.082
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

13:07.082 --> 13:09.592
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

13:09.692 --> 13:11.272
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

13:11.272 --> 13:13.342
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

13:13.552 --> 13:15.232
♪In this vast world♪

13:15.232 --> 13:17.232
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

13:17.382 --> 13:19.592
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

13:19.592 --> 13:21.182
♪Everything ends eventually♪

13:21.272 --> 13:22.772
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

13:22.772 --> 13:25.172
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

13:25.172 --> 13:26.882
♪No matter how time flies♪

13:26.882 --> 13:28.042
♪Even if the falling snow♪

13:28.042 --> 13:29.672
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

13:29.672 --> 13:30.712
♪All I want now♪

13:30.712 --> 13:32.812
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

13:32.812 --> 13:36.072
♪Year after year♪
